  "primary": "A boulder gathers above the target and crashes down.\nAfter 0.6 s a meteor appears above the aim point, falls from 10 blocks up and 0.6 s after landing explodes in a 4-block radius:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire + 2.5 ❤ earth + 1.25 ❤ arcane (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Knockback\n• Breaks up to 6 blocks within 1 blocks (twice as many if brittle)\n• Arcane instability: −0.25 ❤ every 2 s for 4.5 s",
